    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36855" root="كرج" body-key="k">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَرِجَ</span></b> , aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَرَجَ</span></b> ; (or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَرَجَ</span>, inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَرَجٌ</span>, as in
the L,) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اكرج</span></b> ; (K;) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كرّج</span></b> ; (S,
K;) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تكرّج</span></b> ; (S, MA, K;) <i>It</i> (bread)
<i>spoiled,</i> or <i>became bad,</i> or <i>corrupt,</i> (S, MA, K,)
<i>and was overspread with greenness;</i> (S, K;)
<i>it became mouldy</i> or <i>musty.</i> (MA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَرَجَ</span>
<i>It</i> (a thing) <i>became corrupt.</i> (IAar, L.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3- 
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تكرّج</span></b>  <i>It</i> (wheat, or food, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَعَام</span>,) <i>became spoiled,
and overspread with greenness.</i> (L.)

